<!--
    Login screen illustration: two silhouettes with a heart above them.

    Deliberately theme-agnostic — only the accent (#FA4659) and a soft pink
    (#FFDADE) are used, both of which read on the light and the dark background.
    No white or near-black fills, and the background stays transparent so it
    inherits whatever the screen is sitting on.
-->
